{"seq":4,"slug":"marxism","title":"马克思主义理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism","introMarkdown":"# 马克思主义理论 简介\n\n马克思主义理论是一套以唯物辩证法和历史唯物主义为方法论基础，对资本主义生产方式进行系统批判并探索人类解放路径的思想体系。它不仅塑造了二十世纪的世界政治版图，也为理解当代社会的阶级关系、经济危机和意识形态运作提供了不可替代的分析工具。\n\n本知识体系从哲学基础到政治经济学批判，从科学社会主义的理论演进到当代马克思主义的多元发展，为自学者构建完整的马克思主义认知框架。\n\n第一章**马克思主义哲学**阐释辩证唯物主义的基本原理——物质与意识的关系、对立统一规律和否定之否定规律，以及历史唯物主义对社会形态更替的解释框架和马克思主义认识论的实践基础。\n\n第二章**马克思主义政治经济学**深入《资本论》的核心范畴，从商品价值与劳动价值论出发，分析资本积累、剩余价值的产生机制和社会再生产理论，并考察这些分析工具对理解当代资本主义的持续意义。\n\n第三章**科学社会主义**追溯社会主义理论从空想到科学的发展历程，讨论中国特色社会主义的实践逻辑以及社会主义市场经济体制的理论创新，展示马克思主义在不同历史条件下的具体化。\n\n第四章**当代马克思主义**介绍西方马克思主义从卢卡奇到法兰克福学派的文化批判传统，以及马克思主义在文化研究和二十一世纪全球语境中的新发展，帮助自学者理解马克思主义的开放性和生命力。\n\n建议自学者先从哲学基础入手掌握方法论，再进入政治经济学理解批判分析的逻辑，之后在科学社会主义和当代发展中体会理论与实践的辩证关系。阅读马克思恩格斯的经典原著是不可替代的学习环节。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"marxist-philosophy","title":"马克思主义哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/marxist-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dialectical-materialism","title":"辩证唯物主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/marxist-philosophy/dialectical-materialism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-materialism","title":"历史唯物主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/marxist-philosophy/historical-materialism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marxist-epistemology","title":"马克思主义认识论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/marxist-philosophy/marxist-epistemology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"political-economy","title":"马克思主义政治经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/political-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capital-and-surplus-value","title":"资本与剩余价值","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/political-economy/capital-and-surplus-value"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reproduction-theory","title":"再生产理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/political-economy/reproduction-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-capitalism","title":"当代资本主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/political-economy/contemporary-capitalism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-socialism","title":"科学社会主义","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/scientific-socialism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialist-theory-evolution","title":"社会主义理论演进","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/scientific-socialism/socialist-theory-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chinese-socialism","title":"中国特色社会主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/scientific-socialism/chinese-socialism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"socialist-market-economy","title":"社会主义市场经济","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/scientific-socialism/socialist-market-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-marxism","title":"当代马克思主义","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/contemporary-marxism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"western-marxism","title":"西方马克思主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/contemporary-marxism/western-marxism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marxist-cultural-theory","title":"马克思主义文化理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/contemporary-marxism/marxist-cultural-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marxism-in-21st-century","title":"21世纪马克思主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/marxism/contemporary-marxism/marxism-in-21st-century"}]}]}